Scope of this licence
---------------------
This licence covers the source code, configuration files, unit-test fixtures and
protocol/method documentation in this repository, i.e. everything EXCEPT:

  * the manuscript under `papers/**` (preprint, under double-blind review; see NOTICE);
  * model weights, which are not distributed here at all and remain under their own
    upstream terms (see NOTICE);
  * medical imaging datasets and any derived predictions, splits or artifacts, which
    are not distributed here and remain under their own access agreements;
  * third-party PDFs under `references/**`, which are not distributed here.

